# @zoobzio/foundation is a Nuxt layer shipping raw .ts/.vue sources, so
# vue-tsc type-checks its files from inside node_modules. Under pnpm's
# isolated layout the layer's own deps aren't visible from there — hoist the
# ones its type surface imports so resolution succeeds. Versions still come
# from foundation's own dependency ranges.
public-hoist-pattern[]=reka-ui
public-hoist-pattern[]=objectively
public-hoist-pattern[]=untheme
